@startuml
title App startup (NFR-001: cold start < 4 s)
actor Doctor
participant "Webview UI" as UI
participant "hc-app" as APP
participant "hc-licence" as L
participant "hc-storage" as ST
participant "hc-repertory" as R
Doctor -> UI : launch
UI --> Doctor : splash + PIN screen (< 1 s)
Doctor -> UI : PIN
UI -> APP : unlock(pin)
APP -> ST : derive KEK (Argon2id), unwrap DEK, open SQLCipher
ST -> ST : check user_version, migrate if needed (with backup)
APP -> L : verify licence + clock guard
L --> APP : state (Active / Grace / ReadOnly ...)
APP -> R : register packs (manifest + signature only, lazy open)
APP --> UI : session + licence state
UI -> APP : get_today()
APP -> ST : follow-ups due, overdue, today's visits
APP --> UI : Today screen
APP -> APP : background: daily backup if due,\nlocal licence re-check, PRAGMA optimize\n(MVP2: online licence refresh)
@enduml
